---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Books & resources
pageClass: books
permalink: /books/
description: Pastor Bola Akinlabi's forthcoming books and resources. Join the launch list to be first to hear.
---
{%- from "partials/macros.njk" import arrow, bookCover, pageHero -%}

{{ pageHero("Books & resources", "Words to <em>build on.</em>", "A home for Pastor Bola’s forthcoming books, reflections and practical resources for your journey of faith and purpose.") }}

{%- for book in books %}
<section class="section" style="padding-top:0" aria-labelledby="book-{{ book.slug }}">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="reveal" style="padding-block:var(--s-4)">{{ bookCover(book) }}</div>
    <div>
      <span class="tag reveal">{{ book.statusLabel }}</span>
      <h2 id="book-{{ book.slug }}" class="mt-3 reveal" data-delay="1">More to share. <em>More to grow into.</em></h2>
      <p class="muted mt-3 reveal" data-delay="2">{{ book.summary }}</p>
      <dl class="factsheet mt-4 reveal" data-delay="2">
        <dt>Title</dt><dd>{{ book.title }}</dd>
        <dt>Release</dt><dd>{{ book.release }}</dd>
        <dt>Formats</dt><dd>To be announced</dd>
      </dl>

      <form class="panel mt-4 reveal" data-delay="3" name="book-launch" method="POST" data-netlify="true" netlify-honeypot="company" data-success="Thank you — you’re on the launch list. We’ll be in touch when the book is announced." style="background:var(--c-parchment);border-color:var(--c-parchment)">
        <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="book-launch">
        <p class="hp"><label>Company <input name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></p>
        <h3 style="font-size:1.6rem">Join the launch list</h3>
        <p class="form-note mt-1">Be first to hear the title, cover and release date, and receive an early chapter.</p>
        <div class="form mt-3">
          <div class="field"><label for="bl-name">First name</label><input class="input" id="bl-name" name="name" autocomplete="given-name" required></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="bl-email">Email address</label><input class="input" id="bl-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="bl-country">Where are you based?</label>
            <select class="select" id="bl-country" name="region"><option>United Kingdom</option><option>Nigeria</option><option>Canada</option><option>United States</option><option>Elsewhere</option></select>
          </div>
          <div class="full"><button class="btn" type="submit">Notify me {{ arrow() }}</button></div>
        </div>
        <p class="form-status mt-2" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{%- endfor %}

<section class="section section--parchment" aria-labelledby="themes-title">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <h2 id="themes-title" class="reveal" data-delay="1">Faith for <em>everyday life.</em></h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="cards-3">
      <div class="card reveal"><h3>Purpose &amp; calling</h3><p>Discovering what God has placed in your hands, and having the courage to build with it.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="1"><h3>Leadership</h3><p>Excellence, structure and integrity, from the boardroom to the church and the home.</p></div>
      <div class="card reveal" data-delay="2"><h3>Family &amp; restoration</h3><p>Strong marriages, nurtured children, and hope for what has been lost.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap split" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
      <h2 id="faq-title" class="mt-2 reveal" data-delay="1">For readers, churches <em>and groups.</em></h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq reveal" data-delay="1">
      <details><summary>When will the first book be released?</summary><div><p>The title and release date will be announced by Pastor Bola’s team. Join the launch list above and you’ll hear first.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Can our church or women’s group order in bulk?</summary><div><p>Yes. Bulk orders for churches, small groups and conferences will be available at launch. Send an enquiry through the contact page and the team will follow up.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Will there be signed copies or launch events?</summary><div><p>Launch events and signings will be shared with the launch list and on Instagram {{ site.social.instagramHandle }}.</p></div></details>
      <details><summary>Will there be a study guide?</summary><div><p>A small-group discussion guide is planned to accompany the book. Details will follow with the launch.</p></div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
